---
# var-naming[no-role-prefix] (83 of 113 findings) skipped as tracked debt: renaming shared vars (tunnel, bgp, stretches) is a breaking API change needing coordination, not a mechanical fix. Revisit before first publication.
profile: production

skip_list:
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]

exclude_paths:
  # Jinja template, not valid YAML, so ansible-lint cannot parse it.
  - inventory/hosts.yml.j2
  # Runtime-generated WireGuard key cache; never committed.
  - .wg-keys/
